{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of a stressed father who has to balance taking care of his toddler while simultaneously making sure the restaurant they are at stays in one place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PLEASE STOP CRYING: Terrible Twos is a horror game with a design of emulating the stress one may experience when taking a toddler to a public restaurant. Ever feel like you don't want to cook? It may even be worse when you go out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a fast-paced FPS, lighthearted horror game where your goals are to fix up any mess your toddler made, whilst keeping said toddler from crying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete all the crazy tasks ranging from cleaning, cooking to even playing instruments to achieve a record time and the honorable title of &quot;DAD OF THE YEAR&quot;. Or choose an alternative, less honorable ending....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the crispy 90s era graphics for the best experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504530?t=1740529573","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504530?t=1740529573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504530/45c0036d2b17efa3a254691363afd6d0f3debe95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740529573","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504530/45c0036d2b17efa3a254691363afd6d0f3debe95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740529573","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of a stressed 